Package: omx-skins
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: the skin format for openmixer panels
 A skin tells a panel how to draw its standard widgets: knobs, faders,
 switches, selectors, meters and curves. This package carries the schema of a
 skin package's skin.json and the directory skins are installed into, so
 anyone can add a skin by putting a skin package there.
